{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44974","headline":"同薛员外谊喜雨诗兼上杨使君 · 皎然","name":"同薛员外谊喜雨诗兼上杨使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积旱忽飞澍，烝民心亦倾。\n郊云不待族，雨色飞江城。\n燋稼濯又发，败荷滋更荣。\n时随雾縠重，乍集柳丝轻。\n一宿恐鱼飞，数朝徵鹳鸣。\n毒暑澄爲冷，高尘涤还清。\n乃知阴隲数，制在造化情。\n及此接欢贺，临风闻颂声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}